{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_00244","headline":"唐大飨拜洛乐章 拜洛 · 则天皇后","name":"唐大飨拜洛乐章 拜洛","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"菲躬承睿顾，薄德忝坤仪。\n乾乾遵後命，翼翼奉先规。\n抚俗勤虽切，还淳化尚亏。\n未能弘至道，何以契明只。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"则天皇后","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_00244.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_00244","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}